        {
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "在路過劇院附近時，梗平聽到了有人在彈鋼琴的聲音"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "梗平",
          "text": "哪有人會在後巷彈鋼琴？",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 10,
            "image": "keng_neutral_portrait.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "梗平",
          "text": "不可能！絕對不可能！",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 10,
            "image": "keng_neutral_portrait.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "梗平",
          "text": "[靈光一閃]",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 10,
            "image": "keng_neutral_portrait.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "梗平",
          "text": "那一定是旮旯給木的女配角登場環節！",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 10,
            "image": "keng_neutral_portrait.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "越靠近聲音的來源，琴聲越令人着迷"
        },
        {
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "..."
        },
        {
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "順着聲音找到了那條小巷"
        },
        {
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "和設想中的秋葉原後巷不一樣，在昏暗後巷裡，一架孤立的鋼琴響起，少女的指尖輕舞，音符如星光般閃爍，將荒涼化為詩意，彷彿整個世界都在她的旋律中靜止"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "梗平",
          "text": "好美，不覺得這樣真的很神聖嗎？",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 10,
            "image": "keng_neutral_portrait.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "梗平一邊小聲說，一邊試探性地踏出一步"
        },
        {
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "匡噹"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "NoiR",
          "text": "誰！",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 20,
            "image": "noir_normal.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "梗平",
          "text": "去你的鋁罐！這樣不就顯得我很像什麼跟蹤犯嗎？！",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 10,
            "image": "keng_neutral_portrait.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "梗平視覺僅一瞬集中在被他踢走的鋁罐，而再次望向剛剛後巷盡頭，少女和鋼琴的位置時"
        },
        {
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "少女已經連帶着整個鋼琴消失在眼前了，取而代之只是一堆廢物堆"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "梗平",
          "text": "難不成是鬼！？",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 10,
            "image": "keng_neutral_portrait.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "梗平一邊尖叫一邊跑走了..."
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "梗平",
          "text": "是鬼吧！這TM不就是鬼嗎！救命呀！",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 10,
            "image": "keng_neutral_portrait.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "梗平",
          "text": "幪面超人救我呀！",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 10,
            "image": "keng_neutral_portrait.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "逃跑到一辦的梗平靈機一動"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "梗平",
          "text": "不對，如果是幪面超人的話！",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 10,
            "image": "keng_neutral_portrait.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "梗平",
          "text": "區區女鬼！看我用勇氣把他推回去！",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 10,
            "image": "keng_neutral_portrait.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "梗平的大腦回想了一下，找出了華點"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "梗平",
          "text": "話說她不是挺可愛的嗎！",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 10,
            "image": "keng_neutral_portrait.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "..."
        },
        {
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "梗平憑着記憶回到那條小巷"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "梗平",
          "text": "是那個鋼琴聲！",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 10,
            "image": "keng_neutral_portrait.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "後巷依舊靜謐，鋼琴聲在空氣中流淌，梗平小心翼翼地走近，這次沒有踢到鋁罐"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "梗平",
          "text": "Err...原來你還在呀...",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 10,
            "image": "keng_neutral_portrait.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "NoiR",
          "text": "...你能聽見我彈的鋼琴？",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 20,
            "image": "noir_normal.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "梗平",
          "text": "嗯...剛剛我嚇到你了吧？對不起。",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 10,
            "image": "keng_neutral_portrait.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "NoiR",
          "text": "沒關係，只是...沒有人能夠聽見我彈的琴...",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 20,
            "image": "noir_normal.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "少女抬起了頭，灰色瞳孔閃着微光"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "梗平",
          "text": "其實你彈得很好，只是...我有點不敢靠近...",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 10,
            "image": "keng_neutral_portrait.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "NoiR",
          "text": "膽小鬼。",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 20,
            "image": "noir_normal.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "梗平",
          "text": "喂！在...在下不習慣這種地方突然有鋼琴出現啊！",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 10,
            "image": "keng_neutral_portrait.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "梗平",
          "text": "而且被嚇走的不是你嗎！",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 10,
            "image": "keng_neutral_portrait.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "兩個人的臉都莫名其妙的羞紅了起來"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "梗平",
          "text": "在下叫梗平，話說我該怎樣稱呼你？",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 10,
            "image": "keng_neutral_portrait.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "NoiR",
          "text": "NoiR...",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 20,
            "image": "noir_normal.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "沒有再發言，少女的手於黑白間條上再次起舞琴聲響起，梗平站在原地"
        },
        {
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "..."
        },
        {
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "演奏結束，梗平不由得自己鼓掌起來"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "NoiR",
          "text": "這裡是我最喜歡的地方，因為不會有人打擾...但如果是你的話，我可以！",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 20,
            "image": "noir_normal.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "NoiR",
          "text": "那你...會再來嗎？",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 20,
            "image": "noir_normal.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "梗平",
          "text": "如果你不介意的話。",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 10,
            "image": "keng_neutral_portrait.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "NoiR",
          "text": "那麼...明天再見吧。",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 20,
            "image": "noir_normal.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "梗平",
          "text": "那麼，明天再見。",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 10,
            "image": "keng_neutral_portrait.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "NoiR連帶着鋼琴消失離開"
        },
        {
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "夜風輕拂，梗平心裡期待着隔日的相遇"
        },
        {
          "kind": "akiba.event.complete",
          "eventId": "noir_1"
        },
