            ],
            "titlefont": 22,
            "textfont": 16,
            "lineHeight": 22,
            "time": 10,
            "letterSpacing": 0,
            "animateTime": 120
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "隔日，梗平早早就來到後巷"
        },
        {
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "鋼琴的投影在空氣中浮現，NoiR的身影隨之出現"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "梗平",
          "text": "呀！這裡怎麼突然冒出個幽靈啊？",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 10,
            "image": "keng_neutral_portrait.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "NoiR",
          "text": "呀！你——你怎麼在這裡！",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 20,
            "image": "noir_normal.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "兩人都因為意料之外的場景嚇了一跳"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "梗平",
          "text": "不是你約在下在這邊等的嗎？",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 10,
            "image": "keng_neutral_portrait.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "梗平",
          "text": "但是想不到居然能看見這麼珍貴的場面。",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 10,
            "image": "keng_neutral_portrait.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "NoiR",
          "text": "真是的...你這個膽小鬼居然敢反擊[鼓起臉頰]",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 20,
            "image": "noir_normal.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "梗平",
          "text": "我只是想看看你會不會有反應嘛。",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 10,
            "image": "keng_neutral_portrait.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "NoiR",
          "text": "算了...既然你都來了，就坐下來聽吧。",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 20,
            "image": "noir_normal.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "梗平靜靜聆聽，心裡突然冒出一個念頭"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "NoiR",
          "text": "有你在，好像不那麼孤單了。",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 20,
            "image": "noir_normal.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "梗平突然想起什麼，眼神閃爍"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "梗平",
          "text": "那個...你能不能試着彈一首動漫OP？",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 10,
            "image": "keng_neutral_portrait.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "NoiR",
          "text": "動漫OP嗎？雖然有點不同，但如果你有樂譜的話我可以試試。",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 20,
            "image": "noir_normal.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "梗平",
          "text": "[在網上找了樂譜]",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 10,
            "image": "keng_neutral_portrait.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "NoiR",
          "text": "這個聽起來是個有點傷心的故事呢。",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 20,
            "image": "noir_normal.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "NoiR看着琴譜歪著頭說道，梗平輕輕點了頭回應"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "梗平",
          "text": "如果這樣會破壞了你的心情的話就算了吧。",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 10,
            "image": "keng_neutral_portrait.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "NoiR",
          "text": "不會，但是這次我是第一次彈別人所喜歡的歌曲，彈得不好可不要笑話我。[苦笑]",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 20,
            "image": "noir_normal.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "NoiR的指尖落下，熟悉的旋律在後巷響起，帶着一種奇妙的溫暖"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "梗平",
          "text": "真的！比原曲更有感覺！！！",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 10,
            "image": "keng_neutral_portrait.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "NoiR",
          "text": "音樂就是這樣，能讓人心裡亮起燈火。",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 20,
            "image": "noir_normal.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "NoiR",
          "text": "也是能夠連接眾人的扭帶，不論語言，不論國籍。",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 20,
            "image": "noir_normal.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "NoiR",
          "text": "所以我想用更多人聽見我的音樂[稍為露出了失望的表情]",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 20,
            "image": "noir_normal.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "梗平",
          "text": "那個...在下這段時間都可以繼續過來陪你。",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 10,
            "image": "keng_neutral_portrait.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "NoiR瞬間眼前一亮"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "NoiR",
          "text": "有什麼想聽的歌我都會盡量滿足你的，畢竟你可是我的專屬聽眾。",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 20,
            "image": "noir_normal.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "梗平",
          "text": "那麼請做好心理準備了。",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 10,
            "image": "keng_neutral_portrait.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "梗平拿出近五千首收藏的假面騎士歌單逐一介紹，對面的少女目光逐漸呆滯"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "NoiR",
          "text": "時候差不多了，明天...還會來嗎？",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 20,
            "image": "noir_normal.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "梗平",
          "text": "當然會。至少這段時間，在下一直都在。",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 10,
            "image": "keng_neutral_portrait.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "梗平揮手告別，NoiR的臉也泛起了紅暈"
        },
        {
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "..."
        },
        {
          "kind": "akiba.event.complete",
