        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "NoiR",
          "text": "這裡...真的可以嗎？如果你被發現...",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 20,
            "image": "noir_normal.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "梗平",
          "text": "他們跑不過我，儘管彈吧，這裡只屬於你。",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 10,
            "image": "keng_neutral_portrait.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "NoiR",
          "text": "這就是我夢想的舞台...",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 20,
            "image": "noir_normal.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "梗平",
          "text": "而我，會成為你的專屬聽眾無論你彈什麼，我都會聽到最後。",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 10,
            "image": "keng_neutral_portrait.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "NoiR",
          "text": "一直也會？",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 20,
            "image": "noir_normal.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "梗平",
          "text": "一直也會！",
